{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12142","headline":"叹毕少府以持法无隐见系 · 钱起","name":"叹毕少府以持法无隐见系","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"用法本禁邪，尽心翻自极。\n毕公在囹圄，世事何糺纆。\n翠凤呈其瑞，虞罗寄铩翼。\n囚中千念时，窗外百花色。\n落景闭圜扉，春虫网丛棘。\n古人不念文，纷泪莫沾臆。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12142.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12142","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}